 def prerr : String → Unit := fun _ => ()
 
+/-- The Sail backend emits discarded pure actions as `(pure value)`. Lean 4.34's `do`
+elaborator elaborates the continuation twice when optimizing a pure Unit action, making long
+sequences exponential. An identity wrapper bypasses that syntactic optimization and reduces
+away definitionally. Preserve the action identifier so it still resolves at the call site.
+This scoped rule is active when generated modules open `Sail`. -/
+scoped macro_rules
+  | `(doElem| ($action:ident $value:term)) => do
+    unless action.getId == `pure do Lean.Macro.throwUnsupported
+    `(doElem| (id ($action $value)))
+
 end Sail
 
